\@writefile{lot}{\contentsline {table}{\numberline {A.11}{\ignorespaces Full protein encoder profile. \emph  {AA-probe}, \emph  {context-$\Delta $} (within-minus-between protein cosine), \emph  {Floor} (mean-direction cosine), \emph  {Best} (best-projector cosine), \emph  {Lift} ($=$ Best $-$ Floor), \emph  {RankMe} and \emph  {PR} (participation ratio). MC-GearNet's mean L2 norm is $1.5\times 10^6$, with 95\% of its variance in a single dimension.}}{63}{table.A.11}}
